`LIVE_UNVERIFIED`; "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"AI-assisted security review is not human certification. The historical **Full GA** contract remains "},{"id":"p7s4","text":"`gaReady:false` with 18 blockers. Read release verification and scope/limitations before relying on "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"false` with 18 blockers. Read release verification and scope/limitations before relying on a result."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> [!NOTE]\n> **V2.3.1 is the active Stable release candidate.** V2.3.0 remains an unpublished histori"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"cal candidate whose protected Tag Gate failed; its Tag and failure history are retained. V2.3.1 targ"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ets the Windows upgrade/rollback gate repair. It is not available as Stable until its public release"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" page and exact assets are verified. The owner-approved implementation-agent self-review policy does"},{"id":"p8s5","text":" not claim independent human security or legal certification. See V2.3.1 release notes, V2.3.0 histo"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"rical notes, and portable install requirements."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why ArmorBreak?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| The challenge | The design |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Agent integrations reinvent execution | **One Core** behind DSH, MCP, CLI, and application APIs |\n"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"| Model output gets confused with permission | **Policy and operator approval** live outside the mod"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"el |\n| Findings are hard to reproduce | **Task-scoped evidence, hashes, findings, and reports** |\n| "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"First use assumes a paid model | **Offline L0 analysis**, with optional model integrations |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"ArmorBreak is a **research toolkit**, not a guarantee that a target is vulnerable or a substitute fo"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"r independent security assessment."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Option A — verify the published Stable release"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The release page carries six assets: the portable archive, its build manifest, CycloneDX SBOM, SHA-2"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"56 list, Stable Gate result, and GitHub attestation. Use Node.js **22+**; the release CI used Node 2"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" list, Stable Gate result, and GitHub attestation. Use Node.js **22+**; the release CI used Node 24."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Expected archive SHA-256: `5e5aca98da18d4f0cb17db71cf57c5577f8f8f64810a30844bd5237b4ed7b630`"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Expected SBOM SHA-256: `2fd47a2b3970c563a747dffb093a33c042de2488b832604dbcce65ec374755a4`"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Verify provenance with GitHub CLI:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Option B — run from the frozen source tag"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"### First harmless L0 task"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"From either the extracted release or the tag checkout:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Expected:** 46 registered capabilities and one completed L0 task with real task ID and evidence. A"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" rejection is not success; inspect `ARMORBREAK_STATE_ROOT`, `ARMORBREAK_WORKSPACE`, path, and policy"},{"id":"p26s3","text":". The release smoke for this README is recorded in v4-release-smoke.md."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## V2.2.0 Stable verification"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Fact | Recorded value |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Release | v2.2.0 Stable, published 2026-10-26 |\n| Frozen source / tag commit | `94d606ed934d7d288c"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"2946ae7d9d25582d8204a4` |\n| Current main at docs baseline | `60273394dff3386354df42ef852964f240a7914"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"5` |\n| Release CI | 40320111438, **5/5 jobs success** |\n| Exact-source tests | Windows **530/530**, "},{"id":"p29s4","text":"Ubuntu **532/532**, zero failed/skipped/cancelled |\n| Stable Gate | **12/12 PASS**, `releasable:true"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"`; attached `stable-gate.json` |\n| Provenance | attestation 40320111461, `gh attestation verify` suc"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"ceeded locally |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Scope and limitations"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- **46 capabilities / 8 domains** in the recorded registry: **44 L0, 1 L1, 1 L2**; **L3 denied**. Re"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"gistration is not a promise that every optional external analyzer is installed.\n- **9 workflows; 7 D"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"SH Skills; 10 DSH model tools; 7 MCP tools.** These are different interfaces and must not be added i"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"nto one tool count.\n- **12 host entries / 10 L0 / 9 third-party L0** in the current matrix; each hos"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"t retains its own evidence level. Claude Code MCP and Claude Cowork CLI, Gemini CLI and Antigravity "},{"id":"p31s6","text":"are separate rows.\n- **Verified Core:** Universal Core, MCP server, Skills, Offline Golden, recorded"},{"id":"p31s7","text":" local-model verification, and the installer/migration/rollback paths covered by the release CI.\n- *"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"*Experimental Provider Integrations:** OpenAI-compatible, OpenAI Responses, Anthropic Messages, and "},{"id":"p31s9","text":"Gemini Native are `LIVE_UNVERIFIED`; mock and local results do not certify commercial endpoints.\n- *"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"*Historical Full GA:** `gaReady:false`, 18 blockers. Stable is a separate, owner-approved release co"},{"id":"p31s11","text":"ntract and does not waive Full GA.\n- **AI review:** four AI-assisted rounds completed initial review"},{"id":"p31s12","text":"; findings still require remediation/retest. This is not an independent human audit or certification"},{"id":"p31s13","text":".\n- **Provenance:** GitHub OIDC/Sigstore attests build origin and subject binding; it is not a secur"},{"id":"p31s14","text":"ity certification or production code signature."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"**Risk levels:** L0 is local/offline; L1 requires usable isolation and platform approval; L2 require"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"s authorized scope and platform approval; L3 is always denied. See security policy, Stable policy, a"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"scope and platform approval; L3 is always denied. See security policy, Stable policy, and GA review."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"1. **The Agent is not the approval authority.** Policy checks risk, scope, and operator/platform app"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"roval.\n2. **A finding is not proof of exploitation.** Facts, hypotheses, and unverified leads are se"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"parated.\n3. **A protocol mock is not a live-provider result.** Model routing and analysis authorizat"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"ion remain separate."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
